@startuml pyMotorGeo_DataTransform
!theme plain
title pyMotorGeo Data Transformation Pipeline (code-aligned)

object DXF_File
object Entities
object SplitResult
object CountSummary
object HalfUnits
object ClosedFaces
object NamedFaces
object ExportArtifacts

DXF_File : motor.dxf

Entities : list[EntityInfo]
Entities : etype / points / layer / radii

SplitResult : stator: list[EntityInfo]
SplitResult : rotor: list[EntityInfo]
SplitResult : airgap_r_inner / outer / mid

CountSummary : n_poles
CountSummary : n_slots
CountSummary : topology hints

HalfUnits : half_pole
HalfUnits : half_slot
HalfUnits : reconstructed units

ClosedFaces : detect_closed_faces output
ClosedFaces : polygons + area + radius stats

NamedFaces : auto_name_faces + classifier results
NamedFaces : magnet / slot / tooth / yoke / etc

ExportArtifacts : analyzed.dxf
ExportArtifacts : summary json
ExportArtifacts : pyleecan machine (optional)

DXF_File --> Entities : reader.read_entity_list(...)
Entities --> SplitResult : analysis_airgap.split_stator_rotor_by_arc_span(...)
SplitResult --> CountSummary : analysis_rotor.estimate_poles_robust(...)\nanalysis_stator.estimate_slots_robust(...)

SplitResult --> HalfUnits : half_unit.extract_half_pole_entities(...)\nhalf_unit.extract_half_slot_entities(...)
HalfUnits --> ClosedFaces : region_closing.close_one_pole/slot(...)\nregion_closing.detect_closed_faces(...)
ClosedFaces --> NamedFaces : region_closing.auto_name_faces(...)\ntopology_rotor/stator classify(...)

NamedFaces --> ExportArtifacts : export.export_regions_to_dxf(...)\npyleecan_bridge.create_pyleecan_machine(...)

@enduml
